# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

A VPC is a private network between instances of one region (instances only: serverless services do not join
VPCs). Instances join it with `masterdaweb_vpc_attachment`, or when they are created (`vpc_id` on
`masterdaweb_instance`); `members` lists them with their private addresses. Destroying a VPC takes its instances
off it; the account's default VPC is never deleted.

